r ending 2023.","notes":"Update 8/11/2025 Hi Team, Applicant submitted the financial statement for year ending 2022 and 2023"},{"title":"Articles of Incorporation","tag":"Articles of Incorporation","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-11-25","description":"Submit a certified of the AI for each of the following companies: 1. Alea Capital Ltd 2. Gotyou Ltd","notes":"Update 8/12/2025 Internal note: initial due date was 10/10/2024 Customer Reply the certified certificates of incorporation have been uploaded under extra documentation RCL: CoIs submitted. AIs still not submitted. Customer Reply Documents have been uploaded."},{"title":"Share Ledger","tag":"Share Ledger","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-11-17","description":"1. The share ledger of the applicant company is uncertified. Resubmit certified. 2. The share ledger does not reflect the info provided/corporate structure, indicating Gotyou Ltd as the sole shareholder. Clarify. Update if necessary.","notes":"Update 8/12/2025 Initial due date was 10/10/2024, reminder sent and due date updated. Update 8/13/2024 Applicant uploaded the requested share ledger on 08/12/2025 Customer Reply Alea Capital Ltd is the sole shareholder of Alea Overseas N.V. Gotyou Ltd owns the majority of the shares of Alea Capital Ltd. certified copy of share ledger of Alea Overseas N.V. has been uploaded. RCL: Updated SL submitted. Inconsistency results. Update: Updated share ledger submitted indicating Alea Capital Ltd as 100% owner. The UBO register of Alea Capital Ltd submitted does not align with MBR share ledger or corporate structure. To request further Clarification and to Submit certified update share ledger of Alea Capital Ltd. Customer Reply Hi, Please note that the provided structure chart is a group structure. Alea Capital Ltd. is a 100% shareholder of Alea Overseas N.V. and other entities in different jurisdictions. Then we have Got You Ltd. which is 80% shareholder of Alea Capital Ltd. together with Charlotte Lacomte (14%) and others 6%. as far as I can see we have not provided a UBO register for Alea Capital Ltd. please double chek. Internal Note: The updated share ledger has been uploaded, along with an accompanying explanation. If this documentation is still deemed insufficient, we kindly request that RCL provide a clear and detailed explanation of the following statement: \"The UBO register of Alea Capital Ltd submitted does not align with the MBR share ledger or corporate structure.\" Specifically, it would be helpful to clarify what is meant by \"MBR\" in this context, as the abbreviation is not clear."},{"title":"Business Plan - organisational structure","tag":"Business Plan","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-10-16","description":"1. Provide a management structure, outlining key responsibilities and controls. 2. Identify a compliance officer, fluent in AML, and submit their PHDF. (No SOW required to be submitted)","notes":"Update 8/12/2025 Internal note: Initial due date was 10/10/2024 RCL: To inform applicant, that management structure must include all C level personal or state whether they are to be hired, as well as show their main responsibilities and controls. Alternatively to close, once receipt of PHDF for C level as requested by the LC. Customer Reply All the key functions are fulfilled by eMoore N.V. as managing directors."}]}]}]}